  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M/S Amartex Industries Ltd vs Food Safety Officer on 11 September, 2024 1 In The High Court Of Himachal Pradesh, Shimla . Civil Revision No.57 of 2022 Date of Decision : 11.09.2024 M/s Amartex Industries Ltd. ...... Petitioner Versus Food Safety Officer, Mandi and another ......Respondents Coram: The Hon'ble Mr. Justice Bipin Chander Negi, Judge Whether approved for reporting?1 For the petitioner : None for the petitioner. For the respondents : Mr. Gautam Sood, Deputy Advocate General, for respondent No.1. Respondent No.2 proceeded ex parte vide order M/S Amartex Industries Ltd vs Food Safety Officer on 11 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/103115061/ 1 dated 18.07.2022. Bipin Chander Negi, Judge (oral) Despite repeated calls Even, on the last date of hearing, there was no appearance on behalf of the petitioner. Against the said impugned order, a revision has been preferred. The maintainability of the same is highly doubtful, as prima facie, an appeal ought to have been preferred. Whether reporters of Local Papers may be allowed to see the judgment?",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": ""
  },
